<Base title="Process" description="How iv8 works — Discover, Design, Build, Launch, Care. Most websites in 4–6 weeks.">
<section><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">A clear, collaborative process</p><h1>From idea to <em>a website you're proud to share.</em></h1>
<p class="lead">A great website doesn't happen by accident. It starts with a clear plan, thoughtful design and a process that keeps things moving — without adding more to your already full plate. Five steps, in plain language. Cloud, compliance and staffing follow the same shape, with their own timelines in the written plan.</p>
<div class="steps one">
<div class="step"><b>01</b><h3>Discover — Week 1</h3><p>We learn your business, your customers and your goals. You share 3 websites you like and 3 you don't. <strong>You do:</strong> one 45-minute call + a short brief. <strong>You get:</strong> a written scope and a quote, before you commit.</p></div>
<div class="step"><b>02</b><h3>Design — Weeks 2–3</h3><p>Wireframes, then visual design. You see it on desktop and phone before anything is built. <strong>You do:</strong> 2 rounds of feedback. <strong>You get:</strong> a design you have approved, in writing.</p></div>
<div class="step"><b>03</b><h3>Build — Weeks 3–5</h3><p>Design becomes a fast, working website. SEO, speed and accessibility built in, not bolted on. <strong>You do:</strong> approve content. <strong>You get:</strong> a working site on a staging link, tested.</p></div>
<div class="step"><b>04</b><h3>Launch — Week 5–6</h3><p>We test every page, set up hosting, redirects and analytics, then go live. <strong>You do:</strong> nothing — we handle it. <strong>You get:</strong> a live site, your accounts, and a training session.</p></div>
<div class="step"><b>05</b><h3>Care — Ongoing</h3><p>Hosting, updates, backups and small changes, every month. You email, we fix it. <strong>You do:</strong> run your business. <strong>You get:</strong> a site that stays up, and one team to call.</p></div>
</div>
<p style="margin-top:28px"><strong>Timeline:</strong> most websites 4–6 weeks. A focused build with ready content: 3 weeks. Larger builds: 8–12 weeks. Cloud and compliance work is scoped separately, with its own timeline in the written plan.</p>
<p style="margin-top:16px"><a class="btn" href={`${BASE}/contact`}>Contact us →</a></p>
</div></section>
</Base>
